00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.850
FOUR MEN AND ONE MORE

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:43.440
Is this the art room?

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.980
What's this?

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:59.020
This time you brought over a girl
who's as gloomy as India ink.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.270
I bet she sits in a dark room and
searches news sites for the word "regret"

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:08.100
just to see how often people
around the world feel regret,

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:11.520
and grins to herself about it.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.650
Michiru Fukuroi, year 2, class A.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:19.730
A notable delinquent whose infamy
carries past the boundary of our academy.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:20.350
They call him "bossman"
among other things.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.610
"BOSSMAN"

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.440
among other things.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:26.400
If you ranked the students who you should
never get involved with at Yubiwa Academy,

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.860
MICHIRU FUKUROI

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.730
he's the undisputed number one.

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:33.190
Come now, Michiru.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:38.850
You should not say something so
endlessly rude to a woman you just met.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:43.400
I will show just how regretful
I feel about you.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:48.690
Look here, we now have
even more regret filling the world.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:53.350
Nagahiro Sakiguchi, year 3, class A.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.400
He's our student council president
for three years in a row.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.440
A master speaker who won
the position before the election,

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.730
when he gave a speech as
a representative for incoming students

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.400
NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.230
after entering the academy.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.900
Even professional voice actors

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:10.850
marvel at his captivating voice
which captures the hearts of listeners,

