00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:16.850
"Bossman" Mitsuru Fukuroi,
a problem child,

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.310
and Nagahiro Sakiguchi,

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:21.150
the student body president
who basically represents honor students,

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:25.980
are in the same room together.
I couldn't possibly hide my surprise.

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:31.150
Don't complain while drinking the tea
that I brewed for you.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:35.350
Come now. The tea you brew
is scrumptious, Michiru.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.810
Yup, that's right, Michiru!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:42.400
You nabbed a girl as cute as her,
and you're saying she's like a dark room?

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:47.230
I thought you proposed at first sight,
like "Let's live together."

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:50.310
Hyota Ashikaga, year 1, class A.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.520
Though only a first-year,
he's the track team ace.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.700
HYOTA ASHIKAGA

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:59.230
His cute and proportioned face
isn't just that of an angel,

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:01.770
but more like an archangel
who leads all the other angels.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.960
"ARCHANGEL"

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.850
And those beautiful legs.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:14.650
You're Dojima the second-year, right?
Nice to meet you, Mayumi Dojima!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:23.020
Sosaku Yubiwa, year 1, class A.

